WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Hello, I am Eslam Rezq Aldardasawi,
a Mobile App Design and Development student at UCAS.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
This is my personal portfolio website
that I designed using HTML5.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
As we can see at the top, there is a quick navigation bar
that takes us to every section of the page.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
For example, if we click on Projects,
it scrolls down directly to the projects section.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Going back up to the Introduction section,
I included a brief bio about myself

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
and a direct link for anyone who wants
to download my CV in PDF format.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Scrolling down a bit, we find the About Me section,
which talks about my background and hobbies.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Followed by the My Skills section, divided into
technical skills like HTML5, Java, Figma, and Android Studio,

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.000
as well as my soft skills.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Here is my Projects section, where I included
three projects I have worked on:

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:39.000
First, the TailorConnect app design on Figma
with a link to preview it on Behance.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Second, a Hospital Management System
built using Java OOP.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Third, an Educational Center Database System
created on SQL Server.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Below them is an organized table
showing my educational background.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:26.000
As interactive additions, I created an FAQ section
that opens and closes when clicking on a question,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:03:00.000
followed by a complete contact form for any inquiries,
and a map of my location in Gaza that opens in Google Maps.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Finally, in the footer, I added links to LinkedIn, GitHub,
Behance, and my university email. Thank you!